    "result_text": "The test passes. Let me summarize the full-stack change I made.\n\n## Summary\n\nImplemented \"when I open a client, show me the projects I am doing for them\" as an additive, local, full-stack change.\n\n**Server (new endpoint):**\n- `src/main/java/net/officefloor/hq/app/project/ListClientProjects.java` \u2014 logic class for `GET /api/clients/{id}/projects`, returning that one client's projects (joined to the client name), oldest first. Reuses the existing `ProjectView` and follows the same `@HttpPathParameter` pattern as `PayInvoice`.\n- `src/main/resources/officefloor/rest/api/clients/{id}/projects.GET.yml` \u2014 the new endpoint YAML wiring it up (one file per endpoint, under `/api/`).\n\n**Front-end (clients feature only):**\n- Added a `client-open-<id>` button to each client row.\n- Added a `ClientProjects` component that fetches `/api/clients/<id>/projects` and renders a `client-projects-table` reusing the `project-row-<id>` / `project-name` anchors \u2014 scoped to the opened client.\n\n**Schema:** no migration needed \u2014 the `projects.client_id` FK already exists, so this is a read-only view over existing data.\n\nNo changes to pinned scaffolding, the router, the spec, or the projects feature; the clients feature owns its own state and talks only to its own endpoint. `bin/e2e` passes.",
